/* ---------- v0.25.2: controls strip ----------
   A slim see-through strip at the bottom right, beside the hotbar (never on it). Key caps + short words, picked for
   what is going on right now; pad glyphs when the controller was used last. Fades back when you stand idle.
   Settings > General > "Controls strip" (on by default). Drawn in HUD units, so it follows UI scale. */
