/* ================= v0.25.4: Quit Game (desktop app) + save on exit =================
   Pause menu and the Choose-your-miner screen get a Quit Game button (desktop app only; the browser build hides it).
   A small "Save and quit?" box: A / Enter / Y-key = yes, B / Esc / N-key = no. Pad: Y opens it.
   Quitting saves the game (and the host's world file) first, then asks the app to close.
   Closing the window any other way (X, Alt+F4, taskbar) makes the app ask the game to save first (see main.js). */
