  'Pad: right stick zooms': 'On a controller, the right stick zooms the view in and out.',
  'Show key hints': 'The strip of key and button hints along the bottom of the screen.',
  'Keybinds': 'Change which key does what.',
  'Fullscreen': 'Fill the whole screen. Also Alt+Enter.',
  'Show FPS': 'Frames per second in the corner.',
  'Screenshake': 'The screen bumps on hits, falls and blasts.',
  'Reduce flash': 'Softer, fewer white flashes from hits and blasts.',
