/* ================= v0.26.1: controller menu navigation (PNAV) ================= */
/* For menus that have no pad navigation of their own, the D-pad / left stick moves a visible highlight between the
   things you can click, A presses the highlighted one, B backs out (pad B = Esc), LB/RB switch tabs where a menu has
   tabs, Start opens/closes pause. How: every frame the menu's own hit tests (hitBox / inR / drawMenuBtn, plus the
   pack/hotbar slots) are recorded as targets; the highlight moves to the best target in the pushed direction; while the
   pad is in use the mouse is parked on the highlight, so the menu's normal hover tips show and A is a normal click.
   Menus with their own pad navigation (Settings > Audio / Graphics, skills, crafting, patch notes, What's New) keep it.
   Moving the real mouse or touching the screen hands control straight back to the pointer. */
